These crates adapt code from the Nexus zkVM, Copyright Nexus Laboratories,
Ltd., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (`LICENSE-APACHE-2.0`).
The adapted files were modified (Apache-2.0 §4(b)): retargeted at the PVM
instruction set, and changed since throughout. They include the column and
trace framework and the first chips:

- src/air_column/ and derive/ (the `AirColumn` derive);
- src/trace/ (builder.rs, component.rs, eval.rs, utils.rs,
  virtual_column.rs, utils_external.rs);
- src/framework/ (eval.rs, traits/);
- src/lookups/ (logup_trace_builder.rs, macros.rs, range_check.rs,
  relations.rs);
- src/chips/cpu/ and src/chips/range_multiplicity.rs;
- src/side_note.rs, src/prove.rs and src/verify.rs.

src/trace/utils_external.rs is adapted from Stwo's
`coset_order_to_circle_domain_order`, Copyright 2024 StarkWare Industries
Ltd. / Nexus Laboratories, Ltd., licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, as its header states.
